    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haru and Wonder Land\u00a0</strong>is a game where Haru, a young cellist, embarks on an adventure in a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotional Connection and Profound Experience through Music</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is a powerful medium to evoke emotions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story and characters' feelings are expressed through playing music and lyrics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players collect musical notes to complete scores within the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a score is completed, it can be used like a skill in an RPG game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing music allows players to solve puzzles or simply enjoy the melodies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Puzzles and Problem Solving</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are solved through musical performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each performance and note interacts with specific objects in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players create paths, open doors, and find items through music.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harmonizing Exploration and Storytelling</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist embarks on a journey to complete musical scores, lift a curse, and find a way home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through collecting notes and performing, the story and protagonist's emotions unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players gain a deeper understanding of the world and its characters through this immersive experience.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Haru and Wonder Land\u00a0</strong>is a game where Haru, a young cellist, embarks on an adventure in a mysterious world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Emotional Connection and Profound Experience through Music</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Music is a powerful medium to evoke emotions.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story and characters' feelings are expressed through playing music and lyrics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players collect musical notes to complete scores within the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once a score is completed, it can be used like a skill in an RPG game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing music allows players to solve puzzles or simply enjoy the melodies.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Creative Puzzles and Problem Solving</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzles are solved through musical performances.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each performance and note interacts with specific objects in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players create paths, open doors, and find items through music.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Harmonizing Exploration and Storytelling</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist embarks on a journey to complete musical scores, lift a curse, and find a way home.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through collecting notes and performing, the story and protagonist's emotions unfold.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players gain a deeper understanding of the world and its characters through this immersive experience.</p></li></ul>",
